{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mine rock!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/StartMiningSesision2.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep on Mining! is a simple incremental game. Hover your cursor over rocks to automatically mine them. Any rock inside the mining area will spawn pickaxes that mine for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather materials!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h06m16s-2025-06-1510-54-25.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mined rocks drop ores, which are crafted into bars. There is a variety of different material rocks to be mined!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The skill tree!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h19m23s-2025-06-1417-33-17.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your material bars to unlock upgrades inside the skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you mine rocks with more power!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft pickaxes!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-14-21h37m09s-2025-06-1418-02-27.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use different materials to craft new pickaxes. Each new pickaxe has better stats, helping you mine faster and hit harder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talent cards!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h49m31s-2025-06-1510-54-25.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you level up, you earn a talent point. Spend talent points to reveal 3 random talent cards \u2014 pick one to keep! Choosing a card increases the talent level, but also increases rock HP.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Mine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h55m14s-2025-06-1418-28-14.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you unlock the mine, it will automatically mine rocks and instantly craft bars for you. The Mine is the idle mechanic of Keep on Mining!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769130?t=1750107400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769130?t=1750107400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/c46dfa8827a8d86625e4c5cc5c1292844c75215a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750107400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/c46dfa8827a8d86625e4c5cc5c1292844c75215a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750107400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mine rock!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/StartMiningSesision2.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep on Mining! is a simple incremental game. Hover your cursor over rocks to automatically mine them. Any rock inside the mining area will spawn pickaxes that mine for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather materials!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h06m16s-2025-06-1510-54-25.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mined rocks drop ores, which are crafted into bars. There is a variety of different material rocks to be mined!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The skill tree!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h19m23s-2025-06-1417-33-17.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your material bars to unlock upgrades inside the skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you mine rocks with more power!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft pickaxes!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-14-21h37m09s-2025-06-1418-02-27.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use different materials to craft new pickaxes. Each new pickaxe has better stats, helping you mine faster and hit harder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talent cards!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h49m31s-2025-06-1510-54-25.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you level up, you earn a talent point. Spend talent points to reveal 3 random talent cards \u2014 pick one to keep! Choosing a card increases the talent level, but also increases rock HP.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Mine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/vlc-record-2025-06-15-11h55m14s-2025-06-1418-28-14.mp4--ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750107400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you unlock the mine, it will automatically mine rocks and instantly craft bars for you. The Mine is the idle mechanic of Keep on Mining!</p>","developers":["EagleEye Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/320ecc31730377d03c319b411fbf9ee95908d3c2/header.jpg?t=1750107400","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157090,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157090/movie480.mp4?t=1750009837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157090/movie_max.mp4?t=1750009837"},"name":"Keep on Mining! Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157090/4052a0ed05ef3a2f26d9c8d2b7e6e0c0a94584bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750009837","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157090/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750009837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157090/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750009837"}}],"name":"Keep on Mining!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["EagleEye Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}